   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Describe clothes and colors",
   "texto": [
    "Clothing usually goes with o et: in jakke («a jacket»), et skjerf («a scarf»). The colors are adjective and match: in grønn jakke, et grønt skjerf.",
    "Many adjectives add -t with neutral nouns and -e in plural: grønn, grønt, grønne. In Spanish there is also gender and number agreement, but the terminations are different."
   ]
